<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Reset email sent | Readora</title>
    <style>
        * { box-sizing: border-box; }
        body { margin: 0; min-height: 100vh; display: grid; place-items: center; padding: 24px; font: 16px/1.5 system-ui, sans-serif; color: #f4f1ff; background: radial-gradient(circle at top right, #184c52, #121a20 58%); }
        main { width: min(100%, 500px); padding: 36px; border: 1px solid #ffffff24; border-radius: 20px; background: #172329ed; box-shadow: 0 24px 70px #0008; }
        .mark { display: grid; width: 48px; height: 48px; place-items: center; color: #102122; background: #8de0d2; border-radius: 50%; font-size: 1.5rem; }
        h1 { margin: 18px 0 8px; }
        p { color: #c1d0d0; }
        a { display: block; margin-top: 20px; padding: 13px; color: #102122; background: #8de0d2; border-radius: 10px; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <main>
        <div class="mark" aria-hidden="true">✓</div>
        <h1>Check your email</h1>
        <p>If the message doesn’t arrive shortly, check your spam folder. The reset link expires in 10 minutes.</p>
        <a href="/staff/login">Return to staff login</a>
    </main>
</body>
</html>
